{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/pulls/1916","id":4220054943,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTgdRUs77iO2f","html_url":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/1916","diff_url":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/1916.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/1916.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/issues/1916","number":1916,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(desktop): harden plugin approval migration and recovery","user":{"login":"Yuewei-LL","id":308228674,"node_id":"U_kgDOEl8yQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/308228674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL","html_url":"https://github.com/Yuewei-LL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuewei-LL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 这次改了什么\r\n\r\n### 摘要\r\n\r\n本 PR 解决 [#1243](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues/1243)：将插件运行授权的最终权威收敛到 Host 持有的 approval receipt，并为已安装插件提供一次性、等价回填的 legacy migration。\r\n\r\n迁移、journal、quarantine、recovery、owner lease、路径 no-follow、Forge 内容判据和 Renderer fail-closed 逻辑一起加固，确保已安装、已批准、已启用的存量插件升级后继续无感运行，不要求用户重新安装、重新确认权限或重新配置。\r\n\r\n### 变更类型\r\n\r\n- [ ] `feat` 新功能\r\n- [x] `fix` 缺陷修复\r\n- [ ] `refactor` / `perf` 重构或性能优化\r\n- [ ] `docs` / `test` / `chore` 文档、测试或工程维护\r\n- [ ] 其他：\r\n\r\n### 范围\r\n\r\n- 关联 Issue / 需求：Fixes #1243\r\n- 本 PR 包含：\r\n  - Host approval receipt 的权威校验、版本/能力投影和 fail-closed 语义；\r\n  - 已安装 legacy 插件的自动一次性迁移和等价 backfill；\r\n  - migration ledger、journal、quarantine、legacy recovery 和重试处理；\r\n  - owner/session lease、文件路径 no-follow、竞态和安全边界；\r\n  - bundled seed、Forge 内容树/路径判据及对应回归测试；\r\n  - 本地重新批准、市场 token 绑定和 Renderer 侧批准状态门禁；\r\n  - 必要的重新批准 CTA、内置插件恢复提示和禁用危险主操作。\r\n- 明确不包含：\r\n  - Atlassian OAuth 新流程或账号配置；\r\n  - 服务端协议或插件分发服务改动；\r\n  - namespace blanket quarantine 的批量恢复出口；\r\n  - legacy recovery rename 与 install/update 之间统一的每插件独占锁；\r\n  - deposit/save ticket 的 owner/session 绑定。\r\n- 用户可见变化：\r\n  - 存量插件迁移成功后保持原有启用状态，重启后仍保持启用；\r\n  - 迁移或恢复失败时不再继续执行不可信操作，并显示明确的重新批准或恢复提示；\r\n  - 需要人工处理的状态提供明确 CTA，危险主操作在状态不满足时保持禁用。\r\n- 是否存在 breaking change：无。升级路径保持旧安装布局、旧 receipt/ledger 数据和用户配置可继续使用。\r\n\r\n### UI 变化\r\n\r\n涉及插件批准、安装/恢复错误和重新批准状态的 UI，并同步更新 en、ja、ko、zh-CN 四个 locale。\r\n\r\n- 引用的设计规范：`docs/design-rules/DESIGN.md` §4、§10、§11、§14。\r\n- 实现说明：\r\n  - 使用语义化主题 token；\r\n  - 同时保留 Light 和 Dark 两种模式的实现；\r\n  - 错误状态、恢复 CTA 和禁用主操作遵循既有交互约束。\r\n- 截图/录屏：\r\n\r\n  - 截图/录屏（Light/Dark 对照）：\r\n<img width=\"935\" height=\"1230\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b643c114-9f1b-4dbd-afaf-5798dc9cf9d9\" />\r\n<img width=\"812\" height=\"1048\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce65f19e-39b7-40d9-9034-69b532dc9cdd\" />\r\n<img width=\"901\" height=\"1228\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93cc0ee5-0d67-455b-8b93-a21a52069bec\" />\r\n<img width=\"805\" height=\"1053\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e6c57fe-9615-49bb-baa3-edc940ba25ed\" />\r\n\r\n## 怎么验证的\r\n\r\n### 自动验证\r\n\r\n```text\r\npnpm test:unit\r\n结果：通过\r\n\r\npnpm --filter desktop run typecheck\r\n结果：通过\r\n\r\npnpm.cmd demo:legacy-migration\r\n结果：通过\r\n\r\n插件定向测试（本 PR 涉及的批准、迁移、恢复和 Forge 测试集）\r\n结果：390 passed、3 skipped\r\n\r\nownerNamespaceMigration 全文件\r\n结果：66 passed\r\n\r\npnpm check:dco\r\n结果：通过\r\n\r\npnpm check:i18n\r\n结果：通过\r\n\r\npnpm check:i18n-glossary\r\n结果：通过\r\n\r\npnpm check:submodule-forward\r\n结果：通过\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 手工验证\r\n\r\n在 isolated Dev 环境手动执行 XD Atlassian legacy receipt 迁移：\r\n\r\n1. 迁移成功；\r\n2. 重启客户端后插件保持启用；\r\n3. `.legacy-migration.json` 状态为 `completed`；\r\n4. 迁移过程中未删除凭证、Secret、KV、用户偏好或 errand 配置。\r\n\r\n### 未执行的验证\r\n\r\n- Atlassian OAuth 未纳入本次验证，因为迁移前没有配置 Atlassian 账号。\r\n\r\n## 风险\r\n\r\n### 风险分类\r\n\r\n- [ ] 无已知风险\r\n- [x] SQLite / migration\r\n- [ ] system prompt\r\n- [ ] 协议兼容\r\n- [x] 权限 / 安全 / 用户数据\r\n- [x] 存量插件兼容（批准状态 / 指纹 / manifest 校验 / 安装布局 / 包格式）\r\n- [ ] 原生层 / fingerprint / OTA\r\n- [x] 跨平台差异\r\n- [x] 其他：Electron main/preload/IPC、文件系统恢复、Forge 内容遍历与竞态安全\r\n\r\n### 影响与回滚\r\n\r\n- 影响范围：插件批准状态、legacy migration/recovery、安装/更新流程和 Renderer 门禁；不改变服务端协议。\r\n- 存量插件影响：有，但提供自动一次性迁移。迁移只做等价 backfill；旧安装文件保留，用于回滚和旧客户端兼容；不会删除用户凭证、Secret、KV、偏好或 errand 配置。\r\n- 迁移失败处理：\r\n  - 瞬时失败保持可重试；\r\n  - 确定性失败 fail closed，避免插件在不可信状态下继续运行。\r\n- 回滚 / 降级方式：可回滚客户端版本；保留的旧文件和 migration journal/ledger 支持旧客户端兼容或继续重试。\r\n- 基于旧布局的升级、迁移、重启保持启用和 recovery 测试已覆盖在本 PR 的定向测试及 Dev 手工验证中。\r\n- 本 PR 修改插件基座，命中仓库白名单确认门，合并前需要指定把关人明确 Approve。\r\n\r\n### 已知非本次解决范围\r\n\r\n以下边界已在安全约束中保留并明确披露，不作为本 PR 的隐含承诺：\r\n\r\n- namespace blanket quarantine 当前没有批量恢复出口；\r\n- legacy recovery rename 与 install/update 尚未共享统一的 per-plugin exclusive lock；\r\n- deposit/save tickets 当前不是 owner/session-bound。\r\n\r\n## 最新 main 合入说明\r\n\r\n本分支已合入 `origin/main` 的 `5fbd505a`，merge commit 为 `d9431ae477d292e49457ad4146650eac21353ebc`，并带 Signed-off-by。\r\n\r\n合并冲突处理结果：\r\n\r\n- `forge.test.ts` 保留本分支的 `writeScaffold`、`forbiddenRootDirs`、seed root 禁区、no-follow、竞态和安全测试；\r\n- 同时吸收 main 的 `FORGE_GUIDE` 向量维度回放内容及对应断言；\r\n- `ownerNamespaceMigration.test.ts` 增加文件 symlink capability probe：Windows 无文件软链权限时不误报 EPERM，目录 junction 用例仍正常执行；\r\n- main 新增 Pi 图片能力门禁后，补齐 fake pi-test-model 的 `supportsImageInput: true` 测试夹具；\r\n- 本次 merge 未新增安全不变量，仓库内插件安全规则正文无需改动。\r\n\r\n## 提交前检查\r\n\r\n- [x] 已 review 完整 diff\r\n- [x] 每个 commit 都带 DCO 签名（`git commit -s`，见 [DCO](../DCO)）\r\n- [x] UI 改动已在「UI 变化」注明引用的设计规范章节\r\n- [x] 未提交凭证、令牌或授权文件\r\n- [x] 已补充必要文档\r\n- [x] 已确认测试结果或说明未执行原因\r\n\r\n审阅建议优先关注：\r\n\r\n- approval receipt / GhostManager；\r\n- migration / recovery / journal；\r\n- Forge / security；\r\n- market / Renderer 门禁。\r\n\r\n本 PR 需要插件基座白名单把关人明确 Approve 后再合并。\r\n","created_at":"2026-08-06T10:27:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T01:42:44Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11693038690,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAACuPWcYg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/labels/status:awaiting-author","name":"status:awaiting-author","color":"BF8700","default":false,"description":"等作者修改(review-pr 自动维护,仅展示)"},{"id":11693039985,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAACuPWhcQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/labels/touches:plugin-base","name":"touches:plugin-base","color":"E148AC","default":false,"description":"改动碰到插件基座(review-pr 自动维护,仅展示)"},{"id":11693040279,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAACuPWilw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/labels/touches:core","name":"touches:core","color":"168A80","default":false,"description":"改动碰到架构核心路径(review-pr 自动维护,仅展示)"},{"id":11693040360,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAACuPWi6A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/labels/touches:product-ui","name":"touches:product-ui","color":"178E56","default":false,"description":"改动碰到产品 / UI 面(review-pr 自动维护,仅展示)"},{"id":11693040464,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAACuPWjUA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/labels/touches:rules","name":"touches:rules","color":"AC52E3","default":false,"description":"改动碰到规则 / 规范文档(review-pr 自动维护,仅展示)"},{"id":11693040822,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAACuPWktg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/makecindy/cindy/labels/touches:large-diff","name":"touches:large-diff","color":"498516","default":false,"description":"改动量较大(review-pr 自动维护,仅展示)"}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/r